{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53144","headline":"赠何遐 · 韦臯","name":"赠何遐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腰间宝剑七星文，掌上弯弓挂六钧。\n箭发云中双鴈落，始知秦地有将军。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一四五《简州》）（按：《全唐诗》卷三一四收此诗，有缺文，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦臯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}